/\" title=\"Rights to this article\" class=\"has_license\"> <img alt=\"license icon\" role=\"presentation\" src=\"https://arxiv.org/icons/licenses/by-4.0.png\"> <span>view license</span> </a>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n    <!--end full-text-->\n    <div class=\"browse\">\n     <h3 class=\"browse-context-heading\">Current browse context:</h3>\n     <div class=\"current\">gr-qc</div>\n     <div class=\"prevnext\">\n      <span class=\"arrow\"> <a class=\"abs-button prev-url\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/prevnext?id=2608.21590&amp;function=prev&amp;context=gr-qc\" accesskey=\"p\" title=\"previous in gr-qc (accesskey p)\" rel=\"nofollow\">&lt;&nbsp;prev</a> </span> <span class=\"is-hidden-mobile\">&nbsp; | &nbsp;</span> <span class=\"arrow\"> <a class=\"abs-button next-url\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/prevnext?id=2608.21590&amp;function=next&amp;context=gr-qc\" accesskey=\"n\" title=\"next in gr-qc (accesskey n)\" rel=\"nofollow\">next&nbsp;&gt;</a> </span>\n      <br>\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"list\">\n      <a class=\"abs-button abs-button-grey abs-button-small context-new\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/list/gr-qc/new\" rel=\"nofollow\">new</a> <span class=\"is-hidden-mobile\"> | </span> <a class=\"abs-button abs-button-grey abs-button-small context-recent\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/list/gr-qc/recent\" rel=\"nofollow\">recent</a> <span class=\"is-hidden-mobile\"> | </span><a class=\"abs-button abs-button-grey abs-button-small context-id\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/list/gr-qc/2026-08\" rel=\"nofollow\">2026-08</a>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"extra-ref-cite\">\n     <h3>References &amp; Citations</h3>\n     <ul>\n      <li><a class=\"abs-button abs-button-small cite-inspire\" href=\"https://inspirehep.net/arxiv/2608.21590\">INSPIRE HEP</a>\n       <br></li>\n      <li><a class=\"abs-button abs-button-small cite-ads\" href=\"https://ui.adsabs.harvard.edu/abs/arXiv:2608.21590\">NASA ADS</a></li>\n      <li><a class=\"abs-button abs-button-small cite-google-scholar\" href=\"https://scholar.google.com/scholar_lookup?arxiv_id=2608.21590\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google Scholar</a></li>\n      <li><a class=\"abs-button abs-button-small cite-semantic-scholar\" href=\"https://api.semanticscholar.org/arXiv:2608.21590\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Semantic Scholar</a></li>\n     </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"extra-ref-cite\">\n     <button type=\"button\" id=\"bib-cite-trigger\" class=\"bib-cite-button abs-button\">export BibTeX citation</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"bookmarks\">\n     <div>\n      <h3>Bookmark</h3>\n     </div>\n     <a class=\"abs-button abs-button-grey abs-button-small\" href=\"http://www.bibsonomy.org/BibtexHandler?requTask=upload&amp;url=https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.21590&amp;description=Black hole singularity is a surface not a point\" title=\"Bookmark on BibSonomy\"> <img src=\"https://arxiv.org/static/browse/0.3.4/images/icons/social/bibsonomy.png\" alt=\"BibSonomy\"> </a> <a class=\"abs-button abs-button-grey abs-button-small\" href=\"https://reddit.com/submit?url=https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.21590&amp;title=Black hole singularity is a surface not a point\" title=\"Bookmark on Reddit\"> <img src=\"https://arxiv.org/static/browse/0.3.4/images/icons/social/reddit.png\" alt=\"Reddit\"> </a>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <!--end extra-services-->\n   <!-- LABS AREA -->\n   <div id=\"labstabs\"></div>\n   <!-- END LABS AREA -->\n   <div class=\"endorsers\">\n    <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/auth/show-endorsers/2608.21590\" class=\"endorser-who\" rel=\"nofollow\">Which authors of this paper are endorsers?</a> | Disable MathJax (<a href=\"https://info.arxiv.org/help/mathjax.html\">What is MathJax?</a>) <span class=\"help\" style=\"font-style: normal; float: right; margin-top: 0; margin-right: 1em;\"></span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "本文主张黑洞中心的奇点是表面而非点，这对量子引力学有深远影响。",
